## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to implement data governance and privacy in a multi-DC setup: edge TLS, per-tenant policy, hot-reload, and observability with Loki, all integrated via docker-dca.

## Key Concepts

- Traefik edge TLS termination across DCs
- Middleware-based response redaction per-tenant
- Docker Config hot-reload and policy delivery
- Loki-based centralized logs with per-tenant retention
- X-Tenant routing and impact on latency

## Code Example

```javascript
// Express-style middleware skeleton for redacting response payloads per-tenant policy
function redactor(policy) {
  return (req, res, next) => {
    const oldSend = res.send;
    res.send = function (body) {
      let payload = typeof body === 'string' ? JSON.parse(body) : body;
      const tenant = req.headers['x-tenant'];
      const p = policy[tenant] || { redact: [] };
      if (payload && typeof payload === 'object') {
        for (const key of p.redact) {
          if (payload.hasOwnProperty(key)) payload[key] = 'REDACTED';
        }
      }
      oldSend.call(this, JSON.stringify(payload));
    };
    next();
  };
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you test hot-reload correctness and no-downtime guarantees for policy updates?
- How would you measure and mitigate the performance impact of redaction on large payloads?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical ability to add non-intrusive QA in production, teaches traffic manipulation without risking user impact, and validates multi-DC deployment awareness.

## Key Concepts
- Traffic shadowing vs canary releases
- Nginx mirror and upstream configuration
- Docker-DC/edge proxy routing across DCs
- TLS edge termination and tenant isolation

## Code Example
```nginx
# Example shadow config snippet
upstream prod_api { server prod-api:8080; }
upstream staging_api { server staging-api:8080; }
server {
  listen 443 ssl;
  location /api/ {
    proxy_pass http://prod_api;
    mirror /mirror_to_staging;
  }
  location = /mirror_to_staging {
    proxy_pass http://staging_api;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you monitor shadowed traffic to ensure no unseen side effects?
- How would you prevent skew if tenant_id headers can be spoofed?
